--TEST--
after `new` only a name `new` compiles on is offered, so an interface, an enum and an `abstract` class are absent and no reserved word is among them outside a class — `rule:ide/an-accepted-type-writes-what-follows-it`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

interface Priced {}
enum Payment { case Card; }
abstract class PricedItem implements Priced {}
class PricedBook extends PricedItem {}

var $b = new P<|>
--REQUEST--
completion prefix=P
--EXPECT--
PricedBook class     Shop\PricedBook
